    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1190a-a22">

                <pb facs="1273" n="1177" xml:id="pg1177"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-08-12"><hi rendition="#italic">August 12,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>A protocol signed to-day by representatives of the United States and Spain
                    concludes the preliminaries of peace. Spain relinquishes sovereignty to and
                    evacuates Cuba; evacuates and cedes Puerto Rico and other islands in the West
                    Indies and cedes an island in the Ladrones to be selected by the United States.
                    The United States occupies and holds city, harbor and bay of Manila pending the
                    negotiation of treaty of peace which shall determine the control, disposition,
                    and government of the Philippine Islands. Hostilities are forthwith suspended
                    pending execution of these terms. Plenipotentiaries not more than five on each
                    side will meet at Paris on or before October 1 to conclude definitive treaty of
                    peace.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Day.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>(To all United States legations abroad.)</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
